[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[x^8 + 3x^4 - 4 = p_1(x) p_2(x) \dotsm p_k(x),\]where each non-constant polynomial $p_i(x)$ is monic with integer coefficients, and cannot be factored further over the integers.  Compute $p_1(1) + p_2(1) + \dots + p_k(1).$
