[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Lucia gets a head first time, making it 1 chance that she will get head.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Lucia also gets a tail second time away from the head, but since she already flipped a head, there is a 2/3 chance she will get a tail.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Lucia also has a head now, so there is a 1/3 chance she will get back to the head two times
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Lucia thus has the chance for 1 * 2 * 1/3 = 2/3 probability of getting head if the sequence is head, tail, head
