[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This equation can be rewritten as:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[x^5 = \frac{2}{x}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Solving for \(x\), we divide both sides by \(x\) and get:
