[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Since \(2.5555\) is greater than \(\frac{23}{9}\), \(\left\lfloor 2.5555 \right\rfloor = 2\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, \(\left\lfloor\left|-\frac{23}{9}\right|\right\rfloor = 2\).
