[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m These sequences will alternate between \( a_1, \frac{a_1}{2}, a_1, 3a_1 + 1, \ldots \) and \( a_1, 3a_1 + 1, a_1, 3a_1 + 1, \ldots \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Step 3: Sequences That Are Less Than Each of \( a_2, a_3, \) and \( a_4 \)
