[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So the sequence of cards is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1\text{\,JQXY654}\\,2\text{\,XSUXB}\text{\,Z543}\\,3\text{\,N\nSIX}\text{\,O21}\\,4\text{\,NXWSAO}\text{\,L1234}$$\ldots$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We use the divisibility rule for 2. The immediately preceding value to the right of the required spot must be an even integer. We start from the rightmost place in each number:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$\begin{array}{ll} \text{place  of }9&\text{place  of }7\\ \text{place  of }X&\text{place  of }\text{L}\\ \end{array}$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m For the rightmost places, the multiple of 2 is 8, so we move even digits one place to the right:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$\left(
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{array}{ll} \text{place  of }9&\text{place  of }7\\ \text{place  of }X&\text{place  of }\text{L}\\ \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \right) = 4:$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$\boxed{4}$$ the $42$nd card.
