[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1 - sqrt(6)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The simplified expression we found is \(1 - \sqrt{6}\). This confirms that when we add the dot products, we get the correct result.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
