[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m You reprobably thinking how to use the angles given. And it's pretty easy, since there are two equal angles, $ \angle Q = \angle R $, we get a right triangle with the angles $ \angle Q = 30^\circ,\angle R = 105^\circ,$ and $ \angle p = 2x $.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
