[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve the given problem, we first rewrite the given expression:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{b + c + d} + \frac{b}{a + c + d} + \frac{c}{a + b + d} + \frac{d}{a + b + c} = \frac{ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc}{(a + b + c)(b + c + d)(a + c + d)(a + b + c)}.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given that \(a + b + c + d = 1\), we can simplify the expression to:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc}{(a + b + c)(b + c + d)(a + c + d)(a + b + c)} = \frac{ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc}{\left(\frac{1}{a}\right)\left(\frac{1}{b} + \frac{1}{c} + \frac{1}{d}\right)(ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc)},
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m which simplifies further to:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc}{\left(\frac{1}{a(b+c+d)}(ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + dc)\right)}.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
