[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To convert $813_9$ to base 3, we will first convert $813_9$ to its decimal (base 10) equivalent, and then convert that decimal number to base 3.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Convert $813_9$ to decimal:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{array}{r}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   8 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   1 \, 2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   3 \, 3 \, 3 \, 3 \, 3 \, 3 \, 3 \, 3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, $813_9 = 8 \cdot 9^3 + 1 \cdot 9^2 + 2 \cdot 9^1 + 3 \cdot 9^0 = 2104_{10}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we need to convert $2104_{10}$ to base 3:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{array}{r}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, $2104_{10} = 1020_{3}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, $813_9 = 1020_{3}$
