[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, substitute back to find \(v_1\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m v_1 = 9.5 - 33.28
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
