[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the 42nd card in Emily's deck, we need to determine the position of the 42nd card within the deck. In a standard deck of 52 cards, each card is numbered from 1 to 52. Therefore, to find the 42nd card's position, we subtract 1 (since we start counting from 1 and go up to 52) from 42.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 42 - 1 = 41
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Since the 42nd card is the 41st card in the deck, it is in the 42nd position in the sequence.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, the 42nd card is the 41st card from now on.<|endoftext|>
