[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m How many six-inch by six-inch square tiles are needed to cover a three-foot by two-foot rectangular section of floor?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
