[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (8-n) &< 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m n &> 8
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{aligned}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Second, solve for \(m_2\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{aligned}
