[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. **Choose the positions for $\mathcal{MA}_{1}$ and $\mathcal{MA}_{2}$:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     The books can be arranged such that only $\mathcal{MA}_{1}$ or both end up at the ends.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - There are 2 choices (either $\mathcal{MA}_{1}$ is at the ends or both are at the ends).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - Once $\mathcal{MA}_{1}$ or both are fixed, the remaining books automatically form a valid arrangement around them with an empty space in the middle.
