[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m For all positive integers $n$, let $f(n)=\log_{2002} n^2$. Find $f(11)+f(13)+f(14)$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, let's simplify the function $f(n)=\log_{2002} n^2$. By using the property of logarithms, we can get: $$f(n) = 2 \log_{2002} n$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, let's compute $f(11)$, $f(13)$, and $f(14)$ individually:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. For $f(11)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f(11) &= 2 \log_{2002} 11 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 2 \log_{2002} (2 \cdot 5^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 8 \log_{2002} 5
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. For $f(13)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f(13) &= 2 \log_{2002} 13 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 2 \log_{2002} (2 \cdot 53) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 11 \log_{2002} 53
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. For $f(14)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f(14) &= 2 \log_{2002} 14 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 2 \log_{2002} (2 \cdot 7) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 14 \log_{2002} 7
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Adding these three expressions for $f(11)$, $f(13)$, and $f(14)$ together, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f(11) + f(13) + f(14) &= 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 8 \log_{2002} 5 + 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 11 \log_{2002} 53 + 4 \log_{2002} 2 + 14 \log_{2002} 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 8 \log_{2002} 2 + 36 \log_{2002} 53 + 15 \log_{2002} 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 8 \log_{2002} 2 + 36 \log_{2002} 53 + 15 \log_{2002} 7
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}<|endoftext|>
