[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Simplify the Equations
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m From (1):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos^2 A + \cos^2 B + 2 \sin A \sin B \cos C = \frac{15}{8}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Since \(\cos^2 A + \cos^2 B\) is maximized when \(A = B = 60\)-degree angle, which is \(180^{\circ}/1/\pi\), we can identify:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 180^{\circ} - 60^{\circ} - 60^{\circ} = 180^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Similarly, from (2):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos^2 B + \cos^2 C + 2 \sin B \sin C \cos A = \frac{14}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m By substitution:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos^2 (180^{\circ} - X - 180^{\circ}) + \cos^2 (180^{\circ} - X - 180^{\circ}) + 2 \sin (180^{\circ} - X - 180^{\circ}) \sin (180^{\circ} - X - 180^{\circ}) \cos X = \frac{14}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Plug in the values,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 180^{\circ} - A - 60^{\circ} - 60^{\circ} = 180^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 180^{\circ} - A - 60^{\circ} - 60^{\circ} = 180^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Hence,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} \cos(X) + \sin(X) \sin(X) \cos 60^{\circ} = \frac{14}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given \(\cos^2 A + \cos^2 B = \frac{15}{8}\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Andâ€¦
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{1}{2} \cos (X) + \sin(X) \cos (60^{\circ}) = \frac{14}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### \( X = 30^{\circ} \)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m As \(\cos{30^{\circ}} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
