[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Substituting:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cos (30^{\circ}) + \sin (30^{\circ}) \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{14}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
