[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the remainder when $91145 + 91146 + 91147 + 91148$ is divided by 4, let us first calculate the sum of these numbers step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Step 1: Identify the numbers and their representation in base 10.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $91145$, $91146$, $91147$, and $91148$ represent the remainders when 91145, 91146, 91147, and 91148 are divided by 4, respectively.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Step 2: Sum these numbers.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\sum (91145 \times 4) + \sum (91146 \times 4) + \sum (91147 \times 4) + \sum (91148 \times 4)$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To calculate this sum, we multiply each number by 4 and then sum the results.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &m(4 \times 91145) + m(4 \times 91146) + m(4 \times 91147) + m(4 \times 91148) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= (4 \cdot 91145) + (4 \cdot 91146) + (4 \cdot 91147) + (4 \cdot 91148) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= (4 \times 91145) + (4 \times 91146) + (4 \times 91147) + (4 \times 91148) \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 364620 + 36464 + 36468 + 36472 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 14408 + 36464 + 36468 + 36472 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 14408 + 364640 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= 379728 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Step 3: Evaluate the modulo 4 operation.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now we need to find the remainder of $379728 \div 4$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \text{Modulo}\\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4\left(379728 \div 4\right) & = \frac{379728 \times 4}{4} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m & = \frac{1518912}{4} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m & = 379976\mod4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m & = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the remainder when $91145 + 91146 + 91147 + 91148$ is divided by 4 is $\boxed{0}$. toilesystemsystemme<|endoftext|>
