[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. $2t-5 = 2t-8$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The first equation says we worked $t$ hours at $2t-5$ dollars each, so the total amount we earned is $2t-5$ dollars. The second equation says we also earned $t$ dollars at $2$ hours, which totals to $2t$ dollars. 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
