[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. Choose the quarterback: There are 10 possible choices since only 3 members can be physically playing this position.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Choose the running back: There are also 10 possible choices for the running back position, since any player in the starting lineup can play this role.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. Choose the offensive lineman: We have 3 available choices for the offensive lineman position, since it must be a strong player.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
