[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. $2w = z + \frac{17}{z}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. $2x = w + \frac{17}{w}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the real number solutions $(x, y, z, w)$ for $2x = w + \frac{17}{w}$, we will use numerical methods like resolution of linear system where the Lagrange multipliers is used.
