[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Welcome to my calculations. Let's break this down step-by-step:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We have:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{2013^3 - 2 \cdot 2013^2 \cdot 2014 + 3 \cdot 2013 \cdot 2014^2 - 2014^3 + 1}{2013 \cdot 2014}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let's simplify the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2013^3 - 2 \cdot 2013^2 \cdot 2014 + 3 \cdot 2013 \cdot 2014^2 - 2014^3 + 1
