[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - 10 = 2 × 5
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m **Step 2: Find the prime factors of 11.**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - 11 is a prime number, so the only prime factor is 11.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m **Step 3: Find the prime factors of 12.**
