[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve this problem, we need to determine the value of \(k\) such that the two given vectors are coplanar. Two vectors \(\mathbf{v}\) and \(\mathbf{w}\) are coplanar if their scalar triple product is zero. The scalar triple product of \(\mathbf{v}\) and \(\mathbf{w}\) is given by:
