[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve this, we can calculate the determinant and set it equal to zero. Let's use Python to find the value of \(k\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m import numpy as np
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
