[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} a & b & c \\ b & c & a \\ c & a & b \end{pmatrix}\]is not invertible.  List all possible values of
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\frac{a}{b + c} + \frac{b}{a + c} + \frac{c}{a + b}.\]
