[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Convert $74_8$ to base 8:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - The number $74_8$ means $7 \times 8^1 + 4 \times 8^0 = 56 + 4 = 60_{10}$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Further break down 60 into $60_10$.
