[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the value of the expression $49x^2 + 14x(19-7x) + (19-7x)^2$, let's break it down step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. Begin with the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 49x^2 + 14x(19-7x) + (19-7x)^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Expand the product $14x(19-7x)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 14x(19-7x) = 14 \cdot 19 - 14 \cdot 7x \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 266 - 98x \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. Next, expand $(19-7x)^2$ using the binomial theorem:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ (19-7x)^2 = 256 - 2 \cdot 19 \cdot 7x + (7x)^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 256 - 206x + 49x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. Add everything together:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 49x^2 + (266 - 98x)(19 - 7x) + (256 - 206x + 49x^2) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. Distribute $(266 - 98x)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 49x^2 + (266 - 98x) \cdot 19 - 98x(19 - 7x) + 256 - 206x + 49x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 49x^2 + 4734 - 98x \cdot 19 - 98x(19 - 7x) + 256 - 206x + 49x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. Simplify $(266 - 98x) \cdot 19 - 98x(19 - 7x)$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 49x^2 + 4734 - 9802x - 98x \cdot 19 + 98x(19 - 7x) + 256 - 206x + 49x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 49x^2 + 4734 - 98x \cdot 19 - 1956x + 98x(19 - 7x) + 256 - 206x + 49x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 7. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 2x^2 + (4734 - 1956x + 156x - 1956x) + (256 - 206x + 49x^2) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ = 2x^2 - 8401x + 4520 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 8. List your final result:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 2x^2 - 8401x + 4520 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
