[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. Simplify the expression \(12-(-3)^{2}-|{-24}|\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Simplify the expression \(32{x}^{3}⋅{y}^{2}0\div \left(-2{y}^{3}\right){x}^{2}\) under the given values \(x=3, y=-2\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Step 1: Simplify the expression \(12-(-3)^{2}-|{-24}|\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, we evaluate each part of the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
