[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -8 \\ 12 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}.\]If $\theta$ is the acute angle formed by the two lines, then find $\cos \theta.$
