[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let's simplify and compute this:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[x = \frac{100 \pm \sqrt{10000 - 12096}}{178}\]
