[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. **Identify the angles in the triangle:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - We know that the sum of the angles in triangle \( PQR \) is \( 180^\circ \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Let \( x = 64^\circ \). This angle is the angle between line segment \( P \) and line segment \( QR \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. **Analyze the angles in the quadrilateral:**
