[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The pattern repeats every 3 terms. Therefore, we need to find the units digit of \(3^{2009} + 3^{2007} + 3^{2005} + \ldots + 3^1 + 3^2\) except for 3s generated by 3^3.
