[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[3^4 \equiv 1 \text{ (mod 10)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[3^8 \equiv 1 \text{ (mod 4)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[3^{12} \equiv 1 \text{ (mod 16)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[3^{16} \equiv 1 \text{ (mod 9)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, the units digits repeat every 4 terms in the series.
