[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 原式$=\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+2\sqrt{(x+y)^2}$=$\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+2\sqrt{1-(x+y)^2}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 设$\sqrt{1-(x+y)^2}=\alpha $ ,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 原式$=\sqrt{x^2+y^2}+2\sqrt{\alpha^2}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 设$x=y=\dfrac{\alpha^{2}}{2} $即$x-y=0$可得，
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 原式$=\alpha+\dfrac{\alpha}{2}=3\alpha $
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 当 $\alpha =1 $时的取值最大值，即$\frac{\alpha ^{2}}{2}=1$
