[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. \(\sin(1998^\circ + 237^\circ)\) and \(\sin(1998^\circ - 1653^\circ)\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1998^\circ + 237^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1998^\circ - 1653^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Simplify \(1998^\circ + 237^\circ\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1998^\circ + 237^\circ = 2235^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. Simplify \(1998^\circ - 1653^\circ\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1998^\circ - 1653^\circ = 345^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    So, \(\sin(1998^\circ + 237^\circ) = \sin(2235^\circ)\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \(\sin(1998^\circ - 1653^\circ) = \sin(345^\circ)\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. Using the property of sine, we know that \(\sin(360^\circ - \theta) = \sin(\theta)\), so \(\sin(345^\circ - ^\circ) = \sin(^\circ)\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \sin(345^\circ - ^\circ) = \sin(^\circ)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. Combining these results: 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \sin(1998^\circ + 237^\circ)= \sin(1998^\circ + 2235^\circ) = \sin(2235^\circ)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \sin(1998^\circ - 1653^\circ) = \sin(345^\circ)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. Since \(\sin(360^\circ - \theta) = \sin(\theta)\), we know that:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \sin(2235^\circ) = \sin(\theta_1)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \sin(345^\circ) = \sin(\theta_2)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 7. Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
