[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m In $\triangle ABC$, $AC=BC$, and $m\angle BAC=40^\circ$. What is the number of degrees in angle $x$? [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m size(80);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m draw((0,0)--(7,0));
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m draw((0,0)--(3,2)--(6,0));
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m label("$A$",(0,0),W);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m label("$B$",(6,0),S);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m label("$C$",(3,2),N);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m label("$x$",(6,0),NE);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
