[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2a^2 = 12\sqrt{2}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Solving for \( a^2 \), we divide both sides by 2:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m a^2 = \frac{12\sqrt{2}}{2} = 6\sqrt{2}
