[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let us define
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m n! = n\cdot (n-1)\cdot (n-2)\cdot \cdots \cdot 2\cdot 1, \tag{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (n+1)!(n+1)! = n \cdot (n-1) \cdot \cdots \cdot 3 \cdot 2 \cdot 1 = n \cdot (n-1)!\cdots (n+1)!. \tag{2}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, by $(2)$,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m n! \cdot (n+1)! = n \cdot (n-1)!\cdots (n+1)!. \tag{3}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Put $(1)$ and $(3)$ together,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2(n+1)!+6n! = 3(n+1)!.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m It follows that,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (n+1)! \left( 2+3n \right) = 3\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}k!,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m and thus,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (n+1)! \cdot n (3+2n) = \sum_{k=0}^{n-1}k!,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
