[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The sphere's radius will be one-third of the side length of the cube by first determining the height of the inscribed octahedron resulting from the sphere's inscribed shape. Students should measure: 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m * the height of the octahedron
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, we need to find the volume of the sphere.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \text{Volume of the sphere} = \frac{4}{3}\pi r^3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \Rightarrow \pi r^3 = \left(\frac{4}{3}\pi\right) \left(\text{height of the octahedron}\right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The square root can be calculated as: 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \sqrt{\text{side length of original cube}} = 3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Hence, we find that the thickness of the sphere's inscribed octahedron is 3 inches.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{1}{3\sqrt{\text{side length of original cube}}} = \frac{1}{3} r
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \implies \pi r^3 = \frac{4}{3}\pi \left(\frac{1}{3} r\right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Square both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \pi r^3 = \frac{4}{3}\pi r^3 \cdot \frac{1}{9}^3 = \frac{4}{3}\pi \left(\frac{1}{729} r^3\right)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Finally,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{\frac{1}{3}\pi}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
