[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Then, we use the dot product and scalar triple product formulas:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{aligned} \left \| \begin{pmatrix} -8 \\ b \end{pmatrix} \right \| &= \sqrt{(-16)^2 + b^2} \\ &= 16 + b \sqrt{b^2 + 16}. \end{aligned}
