[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The mean of the set of numbers $\{87,85,80,83,84,x\}$ is 83.5. What is the median of the set of six numbers? Express your answer as a decimal to the nearest tenth.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The mean of the set of numbers $\{87,85,80,83,84,x\}$ is 83.5.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the value of $x$, 
