[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To calculate the distance \( \Delta ADB \) in the triangle \( ABD \) where \( A(8,0,0) \), \( B(1,1,3) \), and \( D(2,0,0) \) are vertices of the triangle, we need to find the length of the side \( BD \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, we calculate the distance between points \( A \) and \( D \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
