[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. The swimmer needs to swim 400 meters, and the dolphin needs to swim one-fourth of that, because the dolphin swims at a rate of 8 meters per second. So, we will multiply the time the swimmer needs to swim by the rate of the dolphin.
