[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$14\left(\frac{16}{16}\right) = d$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Step 5:  The left side simplifies to 14, indicating that the product of $d$ and 16 equals 14.
