[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. $f(2) = 2m$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. $f(3) = 3m$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. $f(5) = 5m = 5$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m From the equation $f(5) = 5$, we can calculate $m$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
