[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now we can calculate:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 20 + 8 + 5 \equiv 20 + 1+ 5 \equiv 26 \equiv 4 \mod 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, the correct \(a_{2}0020\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ a_{2}0020 \equiv 4 \mod 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we need to calculate:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ a_{2018} \cdot a_{2020} \cdot a_{2022} \]
