[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find \(a_{3028} \cdot a_{3026} \cdot a_{3024}\), we can use the recurrence relation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ a_{3028} = (4a_{3026} + 4a_{3024} + 4a_{3022}) \mod 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ a_{3026} = (4a_{3024} + 4a_{3023} + 4a_{3021}) \mod 11 \]
