[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We can see that \(a_{3028} \cdot a_{3026} \cdot a_{3024}\) will also be consistent in terms of the periodicity and the calculation. We can use the initial conditions and the periodicity to find the correct value:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ a_{3028} \equiv 26 \mod 11 \]
