[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f(xyz) - f(xyz) = 0 \; \forall x, y, z.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \] This trivially implies that $f(xyz) = f(xyz) = f(xyz) = \cdots$ $= infty,$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m that is, $f = 0$ ($x, y, z$ are not allowed)." But then,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m f( xy ( x_0 + y_0)) + f(xz ( x_0 + z_0)) - f(x \, z ( x_0 + z_0)) f(y ( x_0 + y_0)) + f \; \geqslant\, 1
