[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m implies that
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - 2 f ( x_0 ( x_0 + y_0)) \, f ( x_0 ( x_0 + z_0)) \, f ( y ( x_0 + y_0))  \geqslant\, 1.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \] Hence, $f\in \{ 0, \frac{1}{r}\,\text{for}\; r \neq 0).$
