[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To determine the minimum possible value of the sum \(\sum_{\text{cyc}}\frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a}\), we will use the method of the Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean Inequality (AM-GM Inequality).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, consider the sum:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \sum_{\text{cyc}} \frac{a}{2b} = \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{2c} + \frac{c}{2a}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Using the AM-GM Inequality, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} \geq \frac{a}{2b} \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{b}{2c} \geq \frac{b}{2b} \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{c}{2a} \geq \frac{c}{2a}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Adding these inequalities, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{2c} + \frac{c}{2a} \geq \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{2b} + \frac{c}{2a} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \sum_{\text{cyc}} \frac{a}{2b} \geq 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, consider:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Using the AM-GM Inequality again:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} \leq \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{2b} + \frac{b}{2a} - \frac{a}{2a} - \frac{c}{2a} = \frac{1}{2} - \frac{1}{2a} \quad \text{and}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{b}{4c} \leq \frac{b}{4c} \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{c}{8a} \leq \frac{c}{8a}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Adding these inequalities, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a} \geq \left(\frac{1}{2} - \frac{1}{2a}\right) + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a} \geq 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Since both \(\sum_{\text{cyc}} \frac{a}{2b} \geq 1\) and \(\frac{a}{2b} + \frac{b}{4c} + \frac{c}{8a} \geq 1\), the minimum possible value of the sum is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
