[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We need to find the values of \( x \) for which \( f(x) = 0 \) in both cases.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Case 1: \( x \le 3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m For \( x \le 3 \), the function \( f(x) = 2x + 1 \). We set this equal to zero and solve for \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
