[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given \(f(1, 2) = 3 + 2f(2, 1)\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 1 - 2f(2, 1) = 3 + 2f(2, 1) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 1 - 3 = 2f(2, 1) + 2f(2, 1) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ -2 = 4f(2, 1) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f(2, 1) = -\frac{1}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given \(f(2, 1) = -\frac{1}{2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f(1, 2) = 1 - 2\left(-\frac{1}{2}\right) \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f(1, 2) = 1 + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f(1, 2) = 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \boxed{3} \]<|endoftext|>
