[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let $a$ and $b$ be acute angles such that
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3 \sin^2 a + 2 \sin^2 b &= 1, \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3 \sin 2a - 2 \sin 2b &= 0.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}Find $a + 2b,$ as measured in radians.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
