[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let $m$ and $n$ satisfy $mn=7$ and $m+n=8$. What is $|m-n|$?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. We are given
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m mn=7
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m m+n=8
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. We can rewrite the first equation as
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m m^2-m-7=0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. Solving this equation, we get
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m m=-1 \text{ or } m=7
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. Substituting $m=-1$ into the second equation, we get
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m -1+n=8 \implies n=9
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m |m-n|=|-1-9|=9
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
