[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the number of paths from $A$ to $C$ using only up and to the right steps, we must count the ways to go up exactly $h-1$ times and go right exactly $w$ times. This is given by the binomial coefficient $ \binom{h-1}{w}= \frac{(h-1)!}{w!(h-1-w)!}= \frac{(h-1)!}{w!(h-1-w)!}$. Hence, the number of paths is $\boxed{ \frac{(h-1)!}{w!(h-1-w)!}= \frac{(h-1)!}{w!(h-1-w)!}= \frac{(h-1)!}{w!(h-1-w)!}= 1+^51+\frac{2^{30}-5^4}{30!}}= 1+ 1 +0+ \frac{2^{30}-5^4}{30!}= 1+ 1+\frac{512^2-625}{30\times 29\times 28\times 27 \times 26 \times16 \times 15 \times 14 \times 13 \times 12 \times11 \times10 \times9 \times8 \times7 \times6 \times5 \times4 \times3 \times2 \times1}{30 \times29 \times28 \times27 \times26 \times16 \times15 \times14 \times13 \times12 \times11 \times10 \times9 \times8 \times7 \times6 \times5 \times4 \times3 \times2 \times1}}=1+1+\frac{20274^2-109375}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20274^2 - 109375}{30 \times 29 \times 28 \times 27 \times26 \times16 \times15 \times14 \times13 \times12 \times11 \times10 \times9 \times8 \times7 \times6 \times5 \times4 \times3 \times2 \times1}}= 1+ 1+\frac{20274^2 - 214500}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20274^2 - 109375}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20274^2 - 109200}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{213372256}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!(30 \times29 \times28 \times27 \times26 \times16 \times15 \times14 \times13 \times12 \times11 \times10 \times9 \times8 \times7 \times6 \times5 \times4 \times3 \times2 \times1)}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!(30 \times29 \times28 \times27 \times26 \times16 \times15 \times14 \times13 \times12 \times11 \times10 \times9 \times8 \times7 \times6 \times5 \times4 \times3 \times2 \times1)}= 1+ 1+\frac{213372256}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}=1+1+\frac{20889225}{n!}=1+1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n!}= 1+ 1+\frac{20889225}{n