[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Among these, the smallest positive integer \( n \) is \( 61/7 \), which is approximately \( 8.7143 \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we check if \( n = 8.7143 \) is an integer by converting it to a fraction and seeing if it can be written as a ratio:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
