[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Since the total probability must be $1$, we have $P(A) + P(B) + P(D) = 1$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m From the given probabilities, we can say that $P(A) = \frac{3}{8}$ and $P(B)$ and $P(D)$ cannot be equal or add up to $1$ because the total probability of all possible outcomes is $1$.
