[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m In $\triangle PQR$, point $T$ is on side $QR$ such that $QT=6$ and $TR=10$. What is the ratio of the area of $\triangle PQT$ to the area of $\triangle PTR$? [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m size(6cm);
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m pair q = (0, 0); pair t = (6, 0); pair r = (16, 0);
