[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\begin{aligned}y &= \left(x-3\right)^{2} - 7\left(x-3\right) + 7 \\&= \left(x-3\right)^{2} - 7\left(x-3\right) + 7 \\&= \lim _{x\to 3}\left(\left(x-3\right)^{2}-7\left(x-3\right)\right) \\&= \left(3-3\right)^{2}-7\left(3-3\right) \\&= 0. \end{aligned}$
