[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The terms in the sequence can be expressed with $a$ and $d$ for the second, third, and fourth terms, respectively.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$ a = -2 $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$a+d = 3 $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$a+2d = 33 $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Subtracting the first equation from the fourth equation yields $d$ in terms of $a$. Multiple-choice terms can be assigned $d$: $-3$ for the $2-$th term, $1$ for the $4-$th term, etc.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Finally, the sum of the eight testcases in the  $8-$th equation adds up:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
