[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - The LCM of 4 and 2 is 4.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. **Determine the range of the integers:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - (17/4) is 4 with a remainder 3.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - (35/2) is 17 with a remainder 3.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Therefore, the integers between 4 and 17 that satisfy the condition (base of four)(left); (three) is the range of 11 to 19.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - The integers are 11, 13, 15, and 17.
