[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. **Identify the odd integers:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - The set of these integers is $\{11, 13, 15, 17\}$, which are all odd.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Count the number of odd integers:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - There are 4 odd integers.
