[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve this expression, we need to simplify each term step by step. We have \(\left( 1 - \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\sin 67^\circ} \right) \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\sin 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\cos 67^\circ} \right)\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, let's simplify \(\cos 23^\circ\) and \(\sin 67^\circ\). Using the identity \(\cos (90^\circ - x) = \sin x\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos 23^\circ = \sin 67^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, simplify \(\sin 67^\circ\) and \(\cos 67^\circ\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \sin 67^\circ = \cos 23^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \cos 67^\circ = \sin 23^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now we can substitute these into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\sin 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\sin 23^\circ} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Notice that each cosine term in the product is \(\cos 23^\circ\), and each sine term in the product is \(\sin 23^\circ\). Let's group the \(\cos 23^\circ\) terms together:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\sin 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\sin 23^\circ} \right) = \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( \frac{\cos 23^\circ}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( \frac{\sin 23^\circ}{\sin 23^\circ} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \left( 1 - \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( 1 + \frac{1}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( \cos 23^\circ \right) \left( \sin 23^\circ \right) = \left( \frac{\cos 23^\circ}{\cos 23^\circ} \right) \left( \cos 23^\circ \right) \left( \sin 23^\circ \right) = 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the value of the given expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
