[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Certainly! Let's break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, we we need to rewrite the fractions $\frac{3}{10}$ and $\frac{3}{1000}$ as decimals.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{3}{10} = 0.300 \quad \text{(because }
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \ \frac{3}{10} = 3 \div 10 = 3 \times 10^{-1} = 0.3 \text{)}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
