[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\{\frac{4}{3},\,\frac{5}{3}\}$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The mark of a value is the minimum of all its integers. $\frac{5}{3}$ lies in the interval $\left[\frac{5}{3},2\pi \right]$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The mark of all whole numbers in this interval $[2\pi,2\pi +\frac{2}{3}]$ is $\frac{25}{3}$. Hence, the answer is $\boxed{\frac{25}{3}}$
