[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m A = \sqrt{610}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the area of the scalene triangle is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
