[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ответ:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To determine \(a_{2009}\), let's start by analyzing the given recurrence relation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a_{n + 2} = \frac{a_n + a_{n + 1}}{1 - a_n a_{n + 1}}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given the initial terms:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a_1 = 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a_2 = \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This forms the Fundamental Equations:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a_3 = \frac{a_1 + a_2}{1 - a_1 a_2} = \frac{1 + \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}}{1 - 1 \left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}\right)^2} = \frac{1 + \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}}{1 - \frac{1}{3}} = \frac{1 + \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}}{\frac{2}{3}} = \frac{3 + \sqrt{3}}{2}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a_4 = \frac{a_2 + a_3}{1 - a_2 a_3} = \frac{\frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} + \frac{3 + \sqrt{3}}{2}}{1 - \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} \cdot \frac{3 + \sqrt{3}}{2}} = \frac{\frac{2 + 3\sqrt{3}}{2\sqrt{3}} + \frac{3 + \sqrt{3}}{2}}{1 - \frac{3 + 3\sqrt{3}}{2\sqrt{3}}} = \frac{2 + 3\sqrt{3} + 3 + \sqrt{3}}{2\sqrt{3} - 3 - 3\sqrt{3}} = \frac{5 + 4\sqrt{3}}{-1 - 3\sqrt{3}}\]
