[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Set up the equation for the sum of angles in $\triangle ABC$:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC + \angle ABC + \angle BCA = 180^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC + 40^\circ + \angle BCA = 180^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC + 40^\circ + 40^\circ = 180^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC + 80^\circ = 180^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC = 180^\circ - 80^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \angle BAC = 100^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. **Identify $\angle BAD$:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Point $D$ is inside $\triangle ABC$ such that $\angle ADC = 140^\circ$.
