[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the constants \(p\) and \(q\) such that \(S(k+2) = pS(k+1) + qS(k)\) for all \(k \geq 2\), we start by expressing \(S(k)\) in terms of \(S(1)\) and \(S(2)\).
