[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we substitute the recurrence relation into our expression for \(S(k+2)\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[P(k+3) + Q(k+3) = (P(k+2) + Q(k+2)) + (P(k+1) + Q(k+1)) + (P(k) + Q(k)) + (P(k) + Q(k) - 1) - P(k) - Q(k) + 3 - (k+2)(P(k) + Q(k)) + (P(k) + Q(k) - 1) - 1 + 3\]
