[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ∵ $(5^2-4^2)^3 = (25 - 16)^3 = 9^3 = 4^3 = (32)^3 = 32^3 = 2187 = a^3$ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ∴ $a= \sqrt[3]{2187} = 15$. 
