[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the base-7 sum of the digits in the product of 24_7 and 30_7, we first need to convert these base-7 numbers to base-10. 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 24_7 = 2*7^1 + 4*7^0 = 2*7 + 4 = 16 + 4 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 30_7 = 2*7^1 + 3*7^0 = 2*7 + 3 = 14 + 3 = 17
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Then, we can find the product of 20 and 17 to get the base-10 value of the product.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 20 (base-7) * 17 (base-7) = 340 (base-10)
