[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This process can repeat for the entire point where 11 = 11, and we will then simply add the sequence of metallic remainders to get the quotient:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2003 ÷ 11 = 181 remainder 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m March ----  1   0    0  3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```
