[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Tear ----   1   8   1   0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m That means 181 repeats, then theres again another **decimal remainder**, append 81,601 included, and then 10,722 is the facilitator that was calculated from 5. 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Think of it like a little wave, increasing in every rotation, now drawing a line and having the remainder it 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So the answer is in the sequence of \boxed{{}\times 11 + 1} 626
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
