[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To determine the number of different combinations of non-empty subsets from a set of 7 elements, we must consider the total number of subsets and then subtract the number of single-element subsets.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. **Total number of subsets in the set of 7 elements.**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Each element in the set can either be included or included, for a total of \(2^7\) subsets.
