[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \text{number\_of\_girls} = \frac{26}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, calculate the number of boys who attended:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \text{number\_of\_boys} = \text{number\_of\_girls} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Then, find the number of girls who attended the meeting by subtracting the number of boys who attended from the total number of girls:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \text{number\_of\_girls\_at\_meeting} = \text{number\_of\_girls} - \text{number\_of\_boys} \]
