[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Increase percentage: 20%
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m New width: 24 inches + (20% of 24 inches) = 24 inches + (0.20 * 24 inches) = 24 inches + 4.8 inches = 28.8 inches
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m New height: 16 inches + (20% of 16 inches) = 16 inches + (0.20 * 16 inches) = 16 inches + 3.2 inches = 19.2 inches
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we can calculate the new area:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Original area: 24 inches * 16 inches = 384 square inches
