[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The given equation to be evaluated is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \frac{25}{\%46} - \frac{25}{\%63} + \frac{25}{\%75} = \%8 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
