[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Another observation: URLs can represent URLs to files: `'''bar.axz.123456789'/>` files belonging to the location `'''/foo/bar.axz.123456789/>` which is why this prompt is numbered 3 for `'''1383466210.3049){bar0}'''` URLs. For example, the URL `'''/foo/bar.zip'''` means the downloaded version of it file location in this prompt.
