[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m If $x$, $y$, and $z$ are real numbers for which  \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x+y-z &= -8, \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x-y+z &= 18,\text{ and} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m -x+y+z &= 30, \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*} then what is $xyz$?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve this system of equations, we can start by adding the three equations together:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (x+y-z) + (x-y+z) + (-x+y+z) &= -8 + 18 + 30.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2x + 2z &= 40,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m which further simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[x + z = 20.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we can use this equation to find the values of \(x\) and \(z\). We can express \(z\) in terms of \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[z = 20 - x.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, substitute \(z = 20 - x\) into the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x - y + z &= 18 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x - y + 20 - x &= 18 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m -y &= -8 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y &= 8.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, substitute \(y = 8\) into the expression for \(z\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[z = 20 - x.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
