[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. For \( x \le 0 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - The function value is \( f(x) = x^2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - Every non-negative real number can be expressed as a sum of squares of real numbers, i.e., \( x = a^2 \) for \( a \in \mathbb{R} \).
