[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, let's isolate \( m \) and \( p \) using the second equation. We can do this step-by-step as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. Multiply \(\frac{m + 60}{84}\) by \(84\) to isolate \( m \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \frac{m + 60}{84} \times 84 = (p - m) \times 84
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
