[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \{-7,-5,-3,-2,2,4,6,13\}.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]What is the minimum possible value of \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (a+b+c+d)^{2} + (e+f+g+h)^{2}?
