[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Evaluating at \( x = x \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f^{-1}(x) = \frac{-3x}{2x + 3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m And:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ f(x) = \frac{-3x}{2x + 3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
