[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please write a program to solve it # Python Code
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m import math
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m # Given values
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m cos_theta = 8/17
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m # Calculating sin theta
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m sin_theta = math.sqrt(1 - cos_theta**2)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m # Vector formula for the sum
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m result = (1 + sin_theta) / (1 + cos_theta) + (1 - sin_theta) / (1 - cos_theta)
