[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$y = \boxed{\frac{x + 2}{5x - 7}}$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m subtituting value $x=\boxed{ p}$ in $y$: $$p = \boxed{\frac{p + 2}{5p - 7}}$$ Solving the equation yields:  
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$7(p + 2) = 5p - 7$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$5p = 7p - 14$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$2p = 14$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$p = 7$$   
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m   $$x = \boxed{\frac{14}{7 + 2}}$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m  $$x = \boxed{2}$$<|endoftext|>
