[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. **Square both sides to eliminate the outermost square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
