[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. **Simplify the right-hand side:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 + \sqrt{2 + \sqrt{x}} = (1 + \sqrt{x}) \cdot \sqrt[3]{1 + \sqrt{x}}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Move all terms to one side to set the equation to zero:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
