[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. **Simplify the remaining expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
