[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$\frac{(2^2 \cdot 3 \cdot 5)(2 - b)^{a-g}}{(2 - b)^{(1 - b)(a - b)}} = 3^{(1 - a - b)/(2(1 - b))}$$
