[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let $S$ be a region in the plane with area 4.  When we apply the matrix
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 \\ 7 & 2 \end{pmatrix}\]to $S,$ we obtain the region $S'.$  Find the area of $S'.$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, we find the effect of the transformation on a single point or point. Here, if we consider the origin, we see that the new points of $S'$ are transformed as follows.
