[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 舆论系统
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### 计算：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. 首先计算 $4x^2$，用坐标技巧，其值为：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4 = \frac{4}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 因 16/4 = 4. 所上
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4x^2 = \frac{4}{4} x^2
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. 接着计算 $9y^2$，用坐标技巧，其值为：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 9 = \frac{9}{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y^2 = \frac{y}{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 因此，$9y^2$就是：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 9y^2 = \frac{9}{1} y^2
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. 然后合并（减去 $1$）得：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4x^2 - 1 = \frac{4}{4} x^2 - \frac{9}{1} y^2
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. 求解差分：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4x^2 - \frac{9}{1} y^2
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 当$x=3$和 $y=2$时：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m  \frac{9}{1} y^2 = \frac{9}{1} \times 2^2 = \frac{9}{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. 代入差分：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4-1 = \frac{9}{1} - \frac{9}{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. 完成计算得出：
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3 = \frac{9}{1} - \frac{9}{1}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
