[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4x^2&=16\\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Dividing or squaring both sides by 4 gives us
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
