[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Total cost (in base 10) = ($247_{10}$ for labor) + ($247_{10}$ for equipment) = $494_{10}$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. **Convert $494_{10}$ to base 10 (10)**:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Kirsty must pay $494_{10}$ dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, Kirsty will owe the plumber $\boxed{494}$ dollars.<|endoftext|>
