[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now we have the probabilities of three specific events happening: one even number, both even numbers, and three odd numbers.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The entire probability of exactly two even dice landing on remainders can be computed using the binomial probability formula:
