[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 7. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    2 * angle2 / (2 * angle2) = 7/180
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 8. Simplify the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 = 7/180
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 9. Now, convert 7/180 to degrees:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 = 49/900
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 10. Therefore, the positive difference between the measures of these supplementary angles is the difference between 90 and 49 degrees:
