[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let's analyze the given expression:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$1_2 + 11_2 + 111_2 + 1111_2$$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To add these numbers together, we'll need to combine the numbers in the above-together manner:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{array}{ccccccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1 & 6 \\+ & 5 & 1_2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m + & 1 & 1 & 0_2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m + & 3 & 1 & 1_2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m + & 4 & 3 & 0_2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m + & 8 & 3 & 1_2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m + & 16 & 1 & 0_2 \qquad \text{(This becomes $100_2$)} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we need to convert $100_2$ to base 10. Using the individual digits conversion rules, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1_2 = 1_10 = 1 \, , \, 0_2 = 0_10 = 0 \, , \, 0_2 = 0_10 = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 100_2 = 0 \cdot 2_10 + 1 \cdot 2_10 + 0 \cdot 2_10 + 0 \cdot 2_10 = 2_10
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, the sum in base 10 is $2_10$. Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{2}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
