[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The dilation matrix taken by the given map $f$ sends $\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}$ to $\begin{pmatrix} -12 \\ -21 \end{pmatrix}.$  We normalize it to be a $2\times 2$ matrix, using the scalar times to make the matrix diagonal.
