[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*} 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m & \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\ =\begin{pmatrix} -9 \fac{3} \\ -24 \dfrac{2}{3} \end{pmatrix} \\ 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m & \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\ =\begin{pmatrix} -6 \frac{11}{2} \\ -33 \dfrac{2}{3} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
