[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Then,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \dfrac{5 \dfrac{22}{3} \dfrac{3}{2}}{2 \times 4 m} \qquad & = \qquad \dfrac{11}{2} \dfrac{3}{2} \\ 
