[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, we need to break down the absolute value term \(|y - 1|\). Since \(|x| = x\) when \(x \geq 0\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y > 1 \quad \text{or} \quad y < -1
