[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \sqrt{x^2 + y^2} + y &= 4
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Last, we aim to find both \(x\) and \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ x^2 + y^2 = [3 - (y - 1)]^2 \\[1em] 2x^2 + 2y^2 = 48 \quad \text{or} \quad 2x^2 - 2y^2 = 48 \]
