[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - \(\left|x + 2y - 4\right| = 0 \implies x + 2y - 4 = 0 \implies x + 2y = 4\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - \(\left|x - 1\right| = 0 \implies x - 1 = 0 \implies x = 1\)
