[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. **Consider different cases for the absolute value:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    The expression \(9 - 2y\) indicates that \(2y\) can be either greater than or equal to 9 or less than or equal to 9. Therefore, we need to consider two cases:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Case 1: \(2y \geq 9\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Case 2: \(2y \leq 9\)
