[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    **Case 2: \(2y \leq 9\)**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Divide both sides by 2:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m      y \leq \frac{9}{2} \quad \text{or} \quad y = -\frac{9}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m      \]
