[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We need to find values for \(\triangle\) (the digits \(\triangle\), \(\triangle'\), \(\triangle''\), and \(\triangle'''\)) such that the equation holds true. Since \(\triangle''\) must be between the leading digits of 3 and 4, it must be at least 2 (because \(2^1 = 2\)).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
