[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To simplify the given expression using trigonometric identities, we can use the identity $\cos A \cos B = \frac{1 + \cos (A + B)}{2}$. We'll apply this identity to simplify the given expression.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
