[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The parametric equations of line \(AB\) can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x = 6 + 10t \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y = -7 - 10t \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m z = 7 + 5t
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m or equivalently:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x = 6 + 10t \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y = -7 - 10t \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m z = 7 + 5t
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m #### Line \(CD\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - Point \(C = (0, 3, -6)\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - Point \(D = (2, -5, 10)\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The direction vector of line \(CD\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
