[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Step 2: Set up a system of equations
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We need to find the values of \(t\) for which the parametric equations of \(AB\) and \(CD\) are equal. This gives us the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6 + 10t = 2t \\
