[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*} (a - 1)^3 + (b - 1)^3 &= (4^x + 2^x - 6)^{3} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= (b - 1)^3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m &= (b - 1)^6
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m In the second term, replace $\dfrac{9b^{3}}{4}$ with $1$. Then the equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align*} (a - 1 - (b - 1)^{3})^2 + (a - 1 - (b + 1)^{3}\)^2 &= (b - 1 - 1)^{6} \\ (a - (b - 1)^{3})^{2} + (a - (b + 1)^{3})^{2}&=(b-2)^{2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (a - (b - 1)^{3})^{2}=a^{2}+(b -1)^{6}-2(a - (b - 1)^{3})
