[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the units digit of the sum of the nine terms of the sequence \(1! + 1, 2! + 2, 3! + 3, \ldots, 8! + 8, 9! + 9\), we will focus on the units digits of each term in the sequence and then calculate their sum. We do this by finding the units digit of each term and then summing these units digits.
