[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Consider the inequality \( -2 + 4 + 3x < 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \begin{align}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4 + 3x &< 2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3x &< 2 - 4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3x &< -2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x &< -\frac{2}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \end{align}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
