[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - $x - 2$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m - $2x + 5$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We know the area is given as:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \text{Area} = (x - 2) \times (2x + 5)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This formula is valid because it represents the area of a rectangle. Finally, we know:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \text{Area} = 8x - 6
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, setting the two areas equal to each other, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (x - 2) \times (2x + 5) = 8x - 6
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve for $x$, we will first expand the left side of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (x - 2) \times (2x + 5) = 2x^2 + 5x - 4x - 10 = 2x^2 + x - 10
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, we equate this to the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2x^2 + x - 10 = 8x - 6
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we move all terms to one side of the equation to set it to zero:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2x^2 + x - 10 - 8x + 6 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Simplifying further:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2x^2 - 7x - 4 = 0
