[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Let's solve this quadratic equation using Python.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m import sympy as sp
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
