[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $m^{3}+n^{3}=\left(m+n\right)\cdot\left(m^{2}+n^{2}-mn\right)$,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\therefore x^3+y^3=\left(x+y\right)\left(x^{2}-xy+y^{2}\right)$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\because x+y=9$, $xy=10$, $\therefore x^{2}+y^{2}=\left(x+y\right)^{2}-2xy=9^{2}-20=81-20=61$,
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\therefore x^{2}-xy+y^{2}=\dfrac{1}{2}\left(x^{2}+y^{2}-2xy\right)=\dfrac{1}{2}\times61=30.5$, 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $\therefore$.
