[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Granma Gao's farm has a total of 100 chickens that she raised for vegetable plowing. Each chicken eats 5 carrots per day. If she needs to feed this batch of chickens for one week and each chicken consumes two carrots more in a week than one day, then how many carrots will she need at the end of this week? To determine the total number of carrots Granma Gao needs for the chickens over the course of one week, we break down the problem into several steps.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, let's find out the number of carrots consumed by one chicken in one day. Each chicken eats 5 carrots per day. Therefore, the number of carrots one chicken consumes in one day is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[5 \text{ carrots/day}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, we need to determine how many carrots one chicken consumes in one week. Since the problem states that each chicken consumes two more carrots in a week than one day, we calculate the number of carrots for one chicken consumed in one week as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[5 \text{ carrots/day} + 2 \text{ extra carrots/day} = 7 \text{ carrots/day}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we calculate the total number of carrots consumed by all 100 chickens in one week. Since each chicken consumes 7 carrots per day, the total number of carrots consumed by 100 chickens in one day is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[100 \text{ chickens} \times 7 \text{ carrots/day} = 700 \text{ carrots/day}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the total number of carrots consumed by all 100 chickens in one week, we multiply the daily consumption by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[700 \text{ carrots/day} \times 7 \text{ days} = 4900 \text{ carrots}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, the total number of carrots needed by Granma Gao for the chickens over the course of one week is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\boxed{4900}.\]
