[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m A = \begin{pmatrix} 3a^2 - 3 & 3a \\ 2a^2 - a - 2 & 2a - 1 \end{pmatrix} \quad and \quad B = \begin{pmatrix} -1 & -3a - 2 \\ a & 3a^2 + 2a - 3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We need to compute the product:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m AB = \begin{pmatrix} 3a^2 - 3 & 3a \\ 2a^2 - a - 2 & 2a - 1 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} -1 & -3a - 2 \\ a & 3a^2 + 2a - 3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We'll perform the matrix multiplication step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. Calculate the element in the first row and first column:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (3a^2 - 3) \cdot (-1) + (3a) \cdot a = -3a^2 + 3 + 3a^2 = 3 + 3a
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. The element in the first row and second column:
