[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (3a) \cdot (-3a - 2) + (3a^2 + 2a - 3) \cdot a = -9a^2 - 6a + 3a^3 + 2a^2 - 3a = 3a^3 - 7a^2 - 6a - 3a^3 - 3a = -7a^2 - 9a - 3
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. The element in the second row and first column:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
