[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 2 \\ -10 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -1 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}\]intersect at $P.$  Find the acute angle formed by the two lines at $P,$ in degrees.
