[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. \(7 + 13 = 20\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 7. \(7 + 17 = 24\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 8. \(11 + 13 = 24\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 9. \(11 + 17 = 28\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 10. \(13 + 17 = 30\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, we subtract each product from each of these sums and check which one yields 21, 60, 119, 180, or 231.
