[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Subtracting \(5: 5 + 11 - 16 = -5\), which is not valid since we only have prime numbers.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. Subtracting \(5: 5 + 13 - 18 = -1\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. Subtracting \(5: 5 + 17 - 22 = 0\), which is valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. Subtracting \(7: 7 + 11 - 18 = -6\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. Subtracting \(7: 7 + 13 - 20 = -6\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 7. Subtracting \(7: 7 + 17 - 24 = -2\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 8. Subtracting \(11: 11 + 13 - 24 = -4\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 9. Subtracting \(11: 11 + 17 - 28 = -4\), which is not valid.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 10. Subtracting \(13: 13 + 17 - 30 = -2\), which is not valid.
