[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Hundreds place is from \( \text{100} \) to \( \text{999} - \text{(some number)}).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Tens place is from \( \text{2} \) to \( \text{(some number) being the units digit + 10, and subtracting 10, so this range becomes:} \text{200 to }
