[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Count the even three-digit numbers**:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - There are 10 choices for each hundred place.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    - Moreover, each tens digit being 2, 4, 6, or 8 will minimize the whole range, leaving us with fewer choices.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    
