[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $ABCD$ is a rectangle whose area is 12 square units. How many square units are contained in the area of trapezoid $EFBA$?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
