[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the probability that at least one woman is selected, we first find the probability that none of them are women and then subtract this from 1.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m There are three ways for a group of seven men and three women to be selected without any women, namely, selecting two men and one woman or selecting one man and two women. Since there are three ways to select a man and two ways to select a woman, the probability that none of them are women is
