[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[b + c = 11 \quad \text{(1)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Substitute \(c = 8\) into equation (1):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[b + 8 = 11\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Solving for \(b\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[b = 11 - 8\]
