[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a = 8 - 3\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[a = 5\]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m So, the value of \(a\) is \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
