[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m What is the positive difference between the sum of the first 20 positive multiples of 5 and the sum of the first 20 positive, even integers?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
