[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ x = \frac{100}{4 \left( a - 7 \right)^2} + \frac{3}{4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This is the second solution for \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ x = \frac{100}{4 \left( a - 7 \right)^2} + \frac{3}{4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m However, recall that the solutions to \(\sqrt{4x - 3} = \frac{10}{\sqrt{4x - 3}}\) are only valid for \(a \geq 7\) when considered in the original equation. Therefore, separate the cases as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ### Case 1: \(a \geq 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ \frac{103}{4 (a - 7)^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
