[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the remainder when \(2x^2 - 17x + 47\) is divided by \(x - 5\), we can use the method of polynomial long division or synthetic division. Here, I will explain the synthetic division method as we follow through with the division process.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. **Setup the division:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    We want to divide \(2x^2 - 17x + 47\) by \(x - 5\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. **Set up the coefficients:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Write down the coefficients of the dividend \(2x^2 - 17x + 47\) and the divisor \(x - 5\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Dividend: \(2x^2 - 17x + 47\) (Leading term coef.) | \(2\) | \(-17\) | \(47\) (Subtraction)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Divisor: \(1\) | \(0\) | \(-5\) | \(0\) (Zero subtraction)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. **Choose the first term to divide:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Choose \(2\) as the first term to divide by the zero-bias, which is still \(1\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Multiply and bring down:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Multiply \(2\) by \(1\) (zero-bias), and bring the result down at the next zero position.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \begin{array}{c|cccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    & 2 & -17 & 47 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 & 2 & 0 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. **Perform the division:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Subtract the product from the remaining terms.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \begin{array}{c|cccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    & 2 & -17 & 47 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 & 2 & 0 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    -1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Now we have:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \begin{array}{c|cccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    & 2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 & 2 & 0 & -5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. **Repeat the process:**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Bring down the next term, \(0\), and multiply by \(1\) to get \(0\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \begin{array}{c|cccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    & 2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 & 2 & 0 & -5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    -1 & 2 & 0 & 0 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    Perform the division:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \begin{array}{c|cccc}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    & 2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    1 & 2 & 0 & -5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \hline
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     -1 & 2 & 0 & 0 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     -1 & 2 & 0 & 0 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    The remainder is \( -5 \).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the remainder when \(2x^2 - 17x + 47\) is divided by \(x - 5\) is \(\boxed{-5}\).<|endoftext|>
