[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $x = 4 - \frac{1}{4^n} - \frac{2}{4^{n-1}} - \dotsb = 4x - \frac{1}{4}x$;
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m that simplifies to
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $1\leq k\leq 2$.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m From the exact computation (replace $t$ by $\sqrt[4]{x}$) we can see that it is 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $k = \frac{2}{3}$ or $k = \frac{3}{8}$, hence the answer is $\boxed{\frac{2}{3}}$.
