[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       a^2 + b^2 = 36
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - Adding these two equations together, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       (a^2 - b^2) + (a^2 + b^2) = 16 + 36 \implies 2a^2 = 52 \implies a^2 = 26
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - Substituting \(a^2 = 26\) back into the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       26 - b^2 = 16 \implies b^2 = 10 \implies b = \sqrt{10}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. **Calculating \(a \cdot b\):**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m     - Given \(a = \sqrt{26}\) and \(b = \sqrt{10}\),
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       a \cdot b = \sqrt{26} \cdot \sqrt{10} = \sqrt{260}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m       \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, the value of \(|ab|\) is simply:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{\sqrt{260}}
