[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The vertex of a parabola that opens upwards or downwards is the point where the $x$-coordinate of the parabola is the average of the $x$-coordinates of the roots of the equation $y = ax^2 + bx + c = 0$. Therefore, the $x$-coordinate of the vertex is:
