[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y = -x^2 + 5 = -(x^2 - 5)
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We recognize that:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x^2 \geq 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m And due to the zero-diagonal option in the scenario:
