[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Square both sides of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (x^2 - 5)^2 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Hence:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y = -x^2 + 5 = -(x^2 - 5) = -25
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The negative sign indicates that $(x - \frac{5}{2})^2$ is maximized when:
