[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m sin(\frac{\pi}{2}) = 1
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, the maximum value for $y$ occurs when:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x = \frac{5}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Hence, the maximum value of $y$:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m y = -25
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m $$
