[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now, we expand and move all terms to one side to form a polynomial equation in terms of \( p(x) \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x^4 - 3x^3 + 15x - 25 - (x^2 p(x)) + 3x (p(x) + 5) = 0
