[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m This suggests a particular solution form. By inspecting the terms, we see that the coefficient of \( x^2 \) is \(-3\). Therefore, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
