[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The balanced diagonal sums are 1.0, indicating a consistent and symmetric distribution. The unbalanced diagonal sums, however, are both 1.0, producing the same total sum of 2.0.
