[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m The ordered pair $(d,k)$ is $(6,1/5)$. This is because the determinant of the matrix $\mathbf{A}$ should not be zero since the inverse of $\mathbf{A}$ should be non-trivial. The initial matrix is $\mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ 5 & 6 \end{pmatrix}$.
