[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Substituting $-7$ into the equation, we get \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (-7)^2 + b(-7) -28 &= 0\\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 49 -7b - 28 &= 0\\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m -7b &= -21\\
