[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Pour simplifier la fraction, on obtient : \[ \frac{12}{x \cdot x} \cdot \frac{x^4}{14x}\cdot \frac{35}{3x} = \frac{12}{x^2} \cdot \frac{x^4}{14x} \cdot \frac{35}{3x} \\ \\
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \] \[ = \frac{12}{x^3} \cdot \frac{x^4} {7} \cdot \frac{35}{3x} \\ \\
