[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m If George gets more quarters than dimes, he can get 3 quarters to receive 34 / 27 cents. This is an integer.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m If George gets more dimes than quarters, he can get 8 dimes to receive 836 / 242 cents. This is also an integer.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the sum of the possible amounts of change that George is trying to get is 34 + 836 = 870 cents. That's a total of 870 cents. 🍅coholictoastcakes.com
