[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m For $\bold{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ -4 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\bold{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix},$ compute $\text{proj}_{\bold{w}} \bold{v}$.
