[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To find the sum of all integers \( n \) such that \( \frac{12}{n} \) is also an integer, we start by identifying the divisors of 12. A divisor of 12 is any integer that divides 12 without leaving a remainder. The divisors of 12 are:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
