[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m We need to check if \( \frac{12}{n} \) is an integer for each of these divisors.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. For \( n = 1 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{1} = 12 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 12 \) is an integer, so \( n = 1 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. For \( n = 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{2} = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 6 \) is an integer, so \( n = 2 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 3. For \( n = 3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{3} = 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 4 \) is an integer, so \( n = 3 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 4. For \( n = 4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{4} = 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 3 \) is an integer, so \( n = 4 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 5. For \( n = 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{6} = 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 2 \) is an integer, so \( n = 6 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 6. For \( n = 12 \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \[ \frac{12}{12} = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m    \( 1 \) is an integer, so \( n = 12 \) is a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m These are all the valid solutions. Now, we sum these values:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[ 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 6 + 12 \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
