[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Step 1: Find the largest three-digit cube.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To start, we will use trial and error, as the number in-between magnitudes leads to rough estimation, which is likely enough for this task.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
