[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve for the value of \(\frac{a}{a - 13} + \frac{b}{b - 23} + \frac{c}{c - 42}\), we need to analyze the given system of linear equations and use the method of elimination or substitution.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Given equations:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 13x +  by +  cz = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ax + 23y +  cz = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ax +  by + 42z = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m First, subtract the second equation from the first:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (13x + by + cz) - (ax + 23y + cz) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 13x + by + cz - ax - 23y - cz = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (13 - a)x - (23 - a)y + (ca + c)z = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Next, subtract the third equation from the first:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (13x + by + cz) - (ax + by + 42z) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 13x + by + cz - ax - by - 42z = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (13 - a)x - 42z + (ax - 42z) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m (13 - a)x - 84z = 0
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m x = \frac{84z}{13 - a}
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Now substitute \(x = \frac{84z}{13 - a}\) back into the expression \(ax +  by +  cz \):
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m ax +  by +  cz = a(84z) + b(23y) + c(42z) = 84az + 23by + 42cz
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
