[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Thus, \(a \neq 13\), and the value of \(\frac{a}{a - 13}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \frac{10.9}{10.9 - 13} = \frac{10.9}{-2.1} = -5
