[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Therefore, the value of \(\frac{a}{a - 13} + \frac{b}{b - 23} + \frac{c}{c - 42}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \boxed{-5}
