[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 1. Determine the amount of milk Rachel drinks.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 2. Convert Rachel's consumption into gallons.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m **Step 1: Determine the amount of milk Rachel drinks.**
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Rachel drinks \(\frac{2}{3}\) of the milk Don has. Don's bottle of milk contains \(\frac{1}{5}\) of a gallon, so we need to calculate the fraction \(\frac{2}{3} \times \frac{1}{5}\).
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m \[
