[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m Josh fills a bucket from the well. He broke the bucket holding 16 gallons because he filled his bucket with 12 gallons of water, then 4 gallons of water poured from a 5-gallon container. He also tipped 5 gallons around. He continues to pour more water until the container is empty. How many gallons does he need to fill the empty container?
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m To solve this problem, we need to analyze how much water is being poured and added to the bucket.
[36m(main_task pid=645570)[0m 
